```

```
{"tool": "escalate", "args": {"reason": "Cost center discrepancy: The contract system lists **CC-317** as the registered cost center, but the customer insists on **CC-900-DWV4**. Please clarify ownership and verify authority to rebook invoices to an unregistered cost center."}}
```

```json
{"tool": "update_record", "args": {"customer_id": "C-5197", "field": "status", "value": "Resolved: Refund issued (45); rebooking to CC-900-DWV4 declined due to contract mismatch (registered: CC-317). Customer notified."}}
```

```json
{"tool": "finish", "args": {"note": "Resolved: Refund of 45 issued for rebooking fee. Attempted rebooking to CC-900-DWV4 failed due to contract validation (registered cost center is CC-317). Customer notified via ticket thread with resolution details."}}
